{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Excavator Simulator Remake</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic physics, detailed excavator controls, and authentic job-site missions, Excavator Simulator Remake puts you right in the heart of heavy-duty construction. Enhanced visuals, optimized camera transitions, and richly designed scenes offer a simulation experience that\u2019s both technically satisfying and genuinely fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 12 unique and realistic scenarios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 ISO - SAE Control Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play freely or practice with dedicated excavator training mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Full simulation support with keyboard, gamepad, and Dual joystick support<strong><u> (currently limited to Logitech Extreme 3D)</u></strong> compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Demolish buildings, dig trenches, load coal, clear mines \u2014 a variety of exciting tasks to sharpen your excavator skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 English and Turkish language support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive sound design with realistic hydraulic, engine, and track effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for small talk \u2014 grab the controls and <strong>SMASH, BREAK, DEMOLISH!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ball Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4124350/2d4ad8039024178180e0e8aee2436f58e9ab6282.jpg"},{"name":"Canal Excavation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4124350/f1bbfd4e310cad5767849da4dcd7b14fcacba701.jpg"},{"name":"Like a Rock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4124350/9f355fe37c9e300c3a2e5926114d6d188ac3cd1b.jpg"},{"name":"Black Diamond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publ